   "text": "Metrics\n\n1 tail latency p99.9 (headline)\n2 memory-mgmt CPU share\n   (perf, same rule both)\n3 memory/pod, bytes/entry\n4 CPU per 1k requests\n5 calculated pods/node\n6 image size\n(levels 25/70/110%)",
